1749629448\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Varied Gameplay, Cooperation is Key!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game supports 2\u20134 player local co-op, allowing you and your friends to tackle challenges together\u2014or pull off a few pranks and sabotage each other for laughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Super Dog Adventure</i> encourages teamwork, with each level set introducing new interactive mechanics such as door switches, pressure plates, and synchronized jumps to keep cooperation fun and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9.gif?t=1749629448\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clear the Blocks, Open the Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step on switches or activate items to remove the blocks blocking your way, creating a safe passage for the team. Will you go first, or let your teammates lead the way?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/1.gif?t=1749629448\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Camera Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One player must take on the role of the &quot;cameraperson,&quot; controlling the view to keep everyone on screen. Only by staying in sync can the team move forward smoothly!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/5.gif?t=1749629448\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turbo Ride, Speed Through</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop into a turbo vehicle and race at full speed\u2014hesitate for a moment, and you'll be left behind! Time your moves and cooperate left and right to break through every obstacle!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/4.gif?t=1749629448\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Vertical Climb, Spike Dodge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend through a constantly rising level while dodging deadly spikes! Under pressure, the team must quickly choose the right path. Will it end in a wipeout or a perfect clear? It all depends on your teamwork!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/6.gif?t=1749629448\" /></div></p>","developers":["\u8d85\u7ea7\u72d7\u5192\u9669\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/56cafa977a4d3852a3f00651c0b013279c98476f/header.jpg?t=1749629448","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147657,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147657/movie480.mp4?t=1748513309","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147657/movie_max.mp4?t=1748513309"},"name":" SuperDogPromotionalVideo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257147657/b958ea35c7b8d98801be79eb7997117c548a6e9f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748513309","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147657/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748513309","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147657/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748513309"}}],"name":"Super Dog Adventure","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purcha